  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "Gone are the days of tedious, time-consuming shopping experiences. With Bundle Products, we redefine convenience by bringing together all your essential items into one comprehensive package. Whether you are looking to revamp your wardrobe, upgrade your skincare routine, or stock up on household essentials, our bundles offer everything you need in one convenient click. Say goodbye to endless scrolling and hello to streamlined shopping experiences.": "Voorbij zijn de dagen van vervelende, tijdrovende winkelervaringen. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Bekijk livedemo",
  "Maximize Savings, Minimize Hassle": "Maximaliseer besparingen, minimaliseer gedoe",
  "Saving money has never been easier with our Bundle Product module. By bundling products together, we unlock exclusive discounts and promotions that allow you to maximize your savings with every purchase. Why pay full price for individual items when you can enjoy significant discounts by bundling? Say goodbye to buyer is remorse and hello to smart, savvy shopping.": "Geld besparen was nog nooit zo eenvoudig met onze Bundelproductmodule. ",
  "Tailored to Perfection": "Op maat gemaakt tot in perfectie",
  "We understand that every shopper has unique preferences and needs. That is why our Bundle Product module empowers you to customize your bundles to perfection. Mix and match your favorite products, choose your preferred sizes and colors, and create a bundle that is tailor-made just for you. Whether you are curating the perfect gift set or treating yourself to a well-deserved indulgence, our customizable options ensure that you get exactly what you want, every time.": "Wij begrijpen dat elke shopper unieke voorkeuren en behoeften heeft. ",
  "Discover Endless Possibilities": "Ontdek eindeloze mogelijkheden",
